\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces CST-predicted intelligence emergence roadmap for SDI-based neuromorphic systems. The four engineering generations (Gen1--Gen4) correspond to progressive unlocking of the Triple Lock: Gen1 breaks the $\alpha $-lock (memristive devices, $\alpha $: 0.69$\to $3.91); Gen2 raises $\Gamma _{st}$ via 3D integration; Gen3 coordinates spatiotemporal dynamics via SDI; Gen4 adds photonic interconnect for wafer-scale phase synchrony. Colored horizontal bands indicate the six natural-constant intelligence thresholds ($1/\sqrt  {2}$, 1, $\varphi $, $e$, $\pi $, $\delta $).}}{19}{figure.caption.12}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:cst_roadmap}{{6}{19}{CST-predicted intelligence emergence roadmap for SDI-based neuromorphic systems. The four engineering generations (Gen1--Gen4) correspond to progressive unlocking of the Triple Lock: Gen1 breaks the $\alpha $-lock (memristive devices, $\alpha $: 0.69$\to $3.91); Gen2 raises $\Gamma _{st}$ via 3D integration; Gen3 coordinates spatiotemporal dynamics via SDI; Gen4 adds photonic interconnect for wafer-scale phase synchrony. Colored horizontal bands indicate the six natural-constant intelligence thresholds ($1/\sqrt {2}$, 1, $\varphi $, $e$, $\pi $, $\delta $)}{figure.caption.12}{}}
